d['methodology']='November 1 review ranks all 27 displayed international amateurs together, including reported 2026 signings, projected 2027 candidates, unsigned follows and Oda’s conditional route. These are independent dynasty talent comparisons, not a pure 2027 class ranking or outside publication ranks. Carrying offensive skill or pitching quality, contact/approach, usable impact, running, positional pathway and development risk drive adjacent-player decisions. Evidence confidence is separate from talent risk; missing information is not a below-average tool. Bonus, organization, nationality, date added and previous rank do not determine placement. Signing status, class year and eligibility are preserved separately. Short amateur samples, raw-power opinions and trainer comments are attributed rather than converted into measured professional tools. All seven previously unranked players have individual rationales and source limitations.'
